    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Community on Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/5f5d2af0b29b9172b209d5828bc6834d.avif?t=1745564976\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WEAPONS? MAGIC? BOTH.</strong></h2> <strong>Choose YOUR weapon</strong> - The Parry Master Sword. The Magic Enhancing Chakram. The Lifesteal Lich Hammer. The list goes on.<br><strong>Wield Ancient Magic</strong> - Some Powers annihilate crowds, some are boss-killers, some enhance your weapon. Mix and match Weapons and Powers to create YOUR PERFECT BUILD. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/f0f7a30890454584b5bb412af56b8fe1.poster.avif?t=1745564976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/f0f7a30890454584b5bb412af56b8fe1.webm?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/f0f7a30890454584b5bb412af56b8fe1.mp4?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEGENDARY WEAPONRY</strong></h2> Classic balanced <strong>Swords</strong>. Heavy, devastating <strong>Hammers</strong>. Rapid, ranged <strong>Chakrams</strong>. Find multiple legendary weapons each with unique passive powers to suit YOUR playstyle. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/01d34931115d0eb5ef8349f72ef357af.poster.avif?t=1745564976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/01d34931115d0eb5ef8349f72ef357af.webm?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/01d34931115d0eb5ef8349f72ef357af.mp4?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MIGHTY MAGIC</strong></h2>Soul Crests are ancient magic items that hold the essence of long-forgotten warriors. Each Crest grants Powers that let you live your wildest battlemage fantasies. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/13c75711f4b31a3b6db3bc916b000b95.poster.avif?t=1745564976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/13c75711f4b31a3b6db3bc916b000b95.webm?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/13c75711f4b31a3b6db3bc916b000b95.mp4?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A METROIDVANIA WORLD</strong></h2> Grapple, Glide, Summon Platforms and more! Find Artifices to unlock the world and discover its deepest secrets. Experience the thrill of exploration with the challenge of platforming. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/60eff79ab5995f6867ac2fe075ca0f51.poster.avif?t=1745564976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/60eff79ab5995f6867ac2fe075ca0f51.webm?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/60eff79ab5995f6867ac2fe075ca0f51.mp4?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Quests, everywhere</strong>: Find characters to help and mysteries to solve throughout the world. Beware the consequences of certain choices.<br></li><li><strong>Living World</strong>: Each biome has its theme, lore, dangers, and challenges.<br></li><li><strong>Weapon Stat System</strong>: Each unique weapon has stats that can be unlocked by defeating enemies and bosses, and upgrading at the vendor.<br></li><li><strong>Fully-voiced Story</strong>: Every line of dialogue is performed by a talented cast of voice actors.<br></li><li><strong>Interconnected Map</strong>: Explore as you wish. Gain abilities to unlock areas. Find shortcuts, hidden passages, and more.<br></li><li><strong>Memorable Boss Fights</strong>: Bosses will test you to your limits. Beating them will require skill, tactical-thinking, and unlocking the full potential of your weapons and powers.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>And so much more.</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WEAPONS? MAGIC? BOTH.</strong></h2> <strong>Choose YOUR weapon</strong> - The Parry Master Sword. The Magic Enhancing Chakram. The Lifesteal Lich Hammer. The list goes on.<br><strong>Wield Ancient Magic</strong> - Some Powers annihilate crowds, some are boss-killers, some enhance your weapon. Mix and match Weapons and Powers to create YOUR PERFECT BUILD. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/f0f7a30890454584b5bb412af56b8fe1.poster.avif?t=1745564976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/f0f7a30890454584b5bb412af56b8fe1.webm?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/f0f7a30890454584b5bb412af56b8fe1.mp4?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEGENDARY WEAPONRY</strong></h2> Classic balanced <strong>Swords</strong>. Heavy, devastating <strong>Hammers</strong>. Rapid, ranged <strong>Chakrams</strong>. Find multiple legendary weapons each with unique passive powers to suit YOUR playstyle. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/01d34931115d0eb5ef8349f72ef357af.poster.avif?t=1745564976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/01d34931115d0eb5ef8349f72ef357af.webm?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/01d34931115d0eb5ef8349f72ef357af.mp4?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MIGHTY MAGIC</strong></h2>Soul Crests are ancient magic items that hold the essence of long-forgotten warriors. Each Crest grants Powers that let you live your wildest battlemage fantasies. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/13c75711f4b31a3b6db3bc916b000b95.poster.avif?t=1745564976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/13c75711f4b31a3b6db3bc916b000b95.webm?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/13c75711f4b31a3b6db3bc916b000b95.mp4?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A METROIDVANIA WORLD</strong></h2> Grapple, Glide, Summon Platforms and more! Find Artifices to unlock the world and discover its deepest secrets. Experience the thrill of exploration with the challenge of platforming. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/60eff79ab5995f6867ac2fe075ca0f51.poster.avif?t=1745564976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/60eff79ab5995f6867ac2fe075ca0f51.webm?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/60eff79ab5995f6867ac2fe075ca0f51.mp4?t=1745564976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Quests, everywhere</strong>: Find characters to help and mysteries to solve throughout the world. Beware the consequences of certain choices.<br></li><li><strong>Living World</strong>: Each biome has its theme, lore, dangers, and challenges.<br></li><li><strong>Weapon Stat System</strong>: Each unique weapon has stats that can be unlocked by defeating enemies and bosses, and upgrading at the vendor.<br></li><li><strong>Fully-voiced Story</strong>: Every line of dialogue is performed by a talented cast of voice actors.<br></li><li><strong>Interconnected Map</strong>: Explore as you wish. Gain abilities to unlock areas. Find shortcuts, hidden passages, and more.<br></li><li><strong>Memorable Boss Fights</strong>: Bosses will test you to your limits. Beating them will require skill, tactical-thinking, and unlocking the full potential of your weapons and powers.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>And so much more.</strong></h2>",
